      <p><seg source="#source-50805-50820">どうです　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-50820-50838"><rb>体</rb><rt>からだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-50838-50841">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-50841-50859"><rb>具合</rb><rt><app type="base-text-variant" source="#source-50859-50919"><lem>ぐあ</lem><rdg type="base-text"><seg source="#source-50904-50913">ぐあひ</seg></rdg></app></rt></ruby><seg source="#source-50919-50927">ひは</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-50927-50936">どうも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-50936-50951"><rb>熱</rb><rt>ねつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-50951-50971">が下りません</seg></p>
