      <p><seg source="#source-51607-51616">ここは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-51616-51637"><rb>運河</rb><rt>うんが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-51637-51677">づたひに走つてゐるのです</seg></p>
