      <p><seg source="#source-52366-52371">○</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-52371-52386">なんだか地</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-52386-52404"><rb>面</rb><rt>めん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-52404-52439">の下を歩いてゐるやうだ</seg></p>
