      <p><seg source="#source-53254-53259">○</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-53259-53265">さあ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53265-53280"><rb>猫</rb><rt>ねこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53280-53286">のお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53286-53304"><rb>嬢</rb><rt>ぢよう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53304-53333">さん　あがりますよ</seg></p>
