      <p><seg source="#source-53615-53621">あの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53621-53639"><rb>病</rb><rt>びやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53639-53657">人たちは　地</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53657-53675"><rb>球</rb><rt>きう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53675-53693">の病人なんで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53693-53708"><rb>骨</rb><rt>ほね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53708-53711">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53711-53723"><rb>折</rb><rt>を</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53723-53737">れますね</seg></p>
