      <p><seg source="#source-54895-54900">○</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-54900-54912">おや　お</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-54912-54933"><rb>医者</rb><rt>ゐしや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-54933-54959">さんがやつてきた</seg></p>
