      <p><seg source="#source-61235-61238">大</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-61238-61265"><rb>丈夫</rb><rt>ぢやうぶ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-61265-61313">だよ　そこらへんのボタンをみんな</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-61313-61325"><rb>押</rb><rt>お</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-61325-61348">してみるんだよ</seg></p>
