      <p><seg source="#source-61672-61689">（ヅドン）</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-61689-61706">すごいぞ！</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-61706-61733">わッ！　ロケットが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-61733-61751"><rb>屋根</rb><rt>やね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-61751-61754">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-61754-61766"><rb>突</rb><rt>つ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-61766-61783">きぬけた！</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-61783-61802">すごいぞ！</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-61802-61807">○</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-61807-61816">そこの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-61816-61840"><rb>丸窓</rb><rt>まるまど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-61840-61869">からのぞいてごらん</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-61869-61881">あら！　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-61881-61908"><rb>看護婦</rb><rt>かんごふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-61908-61920">さんが見</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-61920-61938"><rb>送</rb><rt>おく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-61938-61955">つてゐるわ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-61955-61977">看護婦さーん</seg></p>
