      <p><seg source="#source-62479-62484">○</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-62484-62493">どうも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-62493-62517"><rb>見当</rb><rt>けんたう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-62517-62538">がちがつた　地</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-62538-62556"><rb>球</rb><rt>きう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-62556-62616">ぢやない　月に向つて走つてゐるらしいんだ</seg><g ref="#gaiji-1-8-75" source="#source-62616-62652">‼</g></p>
